# Telegram bot credentials for the request form.
# 1. Create a bot with @BotFather and copy the token.
# 2. Add the bot to a group, post a message there, open
#    https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates and take chat.id (groups start with -100).
# 3. Copy this file to .env and put in the real values. NEVER commit .env
#    and NEVER put it inside public_html.
#
# Locally: .env sits at the project root (server/form.php reads it during npm run dev).
# On the hosting: .env sits ONE LEVEL ABOVE public_html, e.g. /home/user/.env.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=000000000:AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA
CHAT_ID=-1000000000000
